Bind series of series of number to f0, given (the series of series of number p0):
    Define v1 as a series of number.
    p0 becomes a series of series of number.
    Return p0.
Done.
Bind void to f1, given (the series of series of number p0, the series of number p1):
    Item 1 of p0 becomes item 1 of p0.
    Define v2 as p1.
    Insert 5 into v2.
    Insert a series of number into p0.
Done.
Define v3 as a series of series of number.
Pull a rabbit.
    v3 becomes cast f0 on (v3).
Done.

Define churn as a series of text.
Define tick as 0.
While tick is less than 400, repeat:
    Insert ("zzzzzzzz" joined to "yyyyyyyy") into churn.
    tick becomes tick + 1.
Done.
State v3.
